#: src/mintmotion:103
msgid "Fill the screen (crops the excess)"
msgstr "填满屏幕（裁掉多余部分）"

#: src/mintmotion:104
msgid "Fit without cropping (black bars)"
msgstr "完整适应（留黑边）"

#: src/mintmotion:105
msgid "Stretch (may distort)"
msgstr "拉伸（可能变形）"

#: src/mintmotion:106
msgid "High (recommended)"
msgstr "高（推荐）"

#: src/mintmotion:107
msgid "Maximum (more work for the GPU)"
msgstr "最高（GPU 负担更大）"

#: src/mintmotion:108
msgid "Saver (basic scaling)"
msgstr "节能（基础缩放）"

#: src/mintmotion:111
msgid "playing"
msgstr "播放中"

#: src/mintmotion:111
msgid "paused"
msgstr "已暂停"

#: src/mintmotion:111
msgid "sleeping"
msgstr "休眠中"

#: src/mintmotion:112
msgid "error"
msgstr "错误"

#: src/mintmotion:112
msgid "stopped"
msgstr "已停止"

#: src/mintmotion:677
msgid "Video as desktop background"
msgstr "将视频设为桌面背景"

#: src/mintmotion:700
msgid "Choose video…"
msgstr "选择视频…"

#: src/mintmotion:711
msgid "Optimize for my screen"
msgstr "为我的屏幕优化"

#: src/mintmotion:713
msgid ""
"Creates a copy of the video at the exact resolution of your screen, at 30 "
"fps at most and without sound: maximum sharpness and minimum resource usage. "
"The original is not touched."
msgstr ""
"按屏幕的精确分辨率生成视频副本，最高 30 帧/秒，不含声音：画面最清晰，资源占用"
"最低。原视频不会被修改。"

#: src/mintmotion:718
msgid "Cancel"
msgstr "取消"

#: src/mintmotion:736
msgid "Screen fit"
msgstr "屏幕适应方式"

#: src/mintmotion:737
msgid "Scaling quality"
msgstr "缩放质量"

#: src/mintmotion:738
msgid "Pause when the desktop is fully covered"
msgstr "桌面被完全遮挡时暂停"

#: src/mintmotion:739
msgid "Hardware decoding"
msgstr "硬件解码"

#: src/mintmotion:753
#, python-brace-format
msgid ""
"Resource usage of {app} (the mpv player and, in Xfce, its supervisor) "
"compared with the whole computer. The work the desktop does to compose the "
"video on screen cannot be separated from the desktop itself, so it is not "
"included."
msgstr ""
"{app}（mpv 播放器，以及 Xfce 下的监控进程）的资源占用与整台电脑的对比。桌面为"
"在屏幕上合成视频所做的工作无法与桌面本身分开统计，因此不包括在内。"

#: src/mintmotion:783
msgid "Uninstall…"
msgstr "卸载…"

#: src/mintmotion:786
#, python-brace-format
msgid ""
"Removes {app} and all its settings from the computer. Your videos are not "
"touched."
msgstr "从电脑中移除 {app} 及其全部设置。不会动你的视频。"

#: src/mintmotion:789
msgid "Remove video"
msgstr "移除视频"

#: src/mintmotion:791
msgid ""
"Stops playing the video and goes back to your static desktop background."
msgstr "停止播放视频，恢复为静态桌面背景。"

#: src/mintmotion:793
msgid "Apply"
msgstr "应用"

#: src/mintmotion:795
msgid "Sets the video as background with these options."
msgstr "按这些选项将视频设为背景。"

#: src/mintmotion:805
#, python-brace-format
msgid "{app} · by {author}"
msgstr "{app} · 作者 {author}"

#: src/mintmotion:834
msgid ""
"You are in a Wayland session. The video background only works in the X11 "
"session (the default one in Linux Mint and LMDE)."
msgstr ""
"当前是 Wayland 会话。视频背景只能在 X11 会话中使用（Linux Mint 和 LMDE 的默认"
"会话）。"

#: src/mintmotion:837
#, python-brace-format
msgid "{app} needs the Cinnamon or Xfce desktop."
msgstr "{app} 需要 Cinnamon 或 Xfce 桌面。"

#: src/mintmotion:839 src/mintmotion:1016 src/mintmotion:1358
#, python-brace-format
msgid "The Xfce part of {app} is not installed (mintmotion-xfce is missing)."
msgstr "{app} 的 Xfce 组件未安装（缺少 mintmotion-xfce）。"

#: src/mintmotion:842
msgid "mpv is missing: install it with “sudo apt install mpv”."
msgstr "缺少 mpv：请用“sudo apt install mpv”安装。"

#: src/mintmotion:880
msgid "_Close"
msgstr "关闭(_C)"

#: src/mintmotion:891
msgid "No video selected"
msgstr "未选择视频"

#: src/mintmotion:899
msgid "The file no longer exists."
msgstr "文件已不存在。"

#: src/mintmotion:910
msgid "Not recognized as a video."
msgstr "无法识别为视频。"

#: src/mintmotion:929
#, python-brace-format
msgid "Ideal for your screen ({w}×{h})."
msgstr "非常适合你的屏幕（{w}×{h}）。"

#: src/mintmotion:934
#, python-brace-format
msgid "your screen is {w}×{h}"
msgstr "你的屏幕是 {w}×{h}"

#: src/mintmotion:936
msgid "more than 30 fps costs more without being noticeable in a background"
msgstr "超过 30 帧/秒会更耗资源，而作为背景看不出区别"

#: src/mintmotion:938
msgid "H.264 is the format that any graphics card decodes best"
msgstr "H.264 是所有显卡都解码得最好的格式"

#: src/mintmotion:939
#, python-brace-format
msgid "Can be optimized: {reasons}."
msgstr "可以优化：{reasons}。"

#: src/mintmotion:964
msgid "Choose a video"
msgstr "选择视频"

#: src/mintmotion:966 src/mintmotion:1036 src/mintmotion:1042
#: src/mintmotion:1072
msgid "_Cancel"
msgstr "取消(_C)"

#: src/mintmotion:966 src/mintmotion:1042
msgid "_Open"
msgstr "打开(_O)"

#: src/mintmotion:969
msgid "Videos"
msgstr "视频"

#: src/mintmotion:976
msgid "All files"
msgstr "所有文件"

#: src/mintmotion:1015
msgid "The video could not be started."
msgstr "无法启动视频。"

#: src/mintmotion:1020
msgid "Cinnamon was not found."
msgstr "未找到 Cinnamon。"

#: src/mintmotion:1021
#, python-brace-format
msgid "{app} works as an extension of the Cinnamon desktop."
msgstr "{app} 以 Cinnamon 桌面扩展的形式运行。"

#: src/mintmotion:1034
msgid "Your previous desktop background no longer exists"
msgstr "之前的桌面背景已不存在"

#: src/mintmotion:1035
msgid "Choose an image to set as desktop background."
msgstr "请选择一张图片作为桌面背景。"

#: src/mintmotion:1037
msgid "_Choose image…"
msgstr "选择图片(_C)…"

#: src/mintmotion:1040
msgid "Choose a background image"
msgstr "选择背景图片"

#: src/mintmotion:1044
msgid "Images"
msgstr "图片"

#: src/mintmotion:1068
#, python-brace-format
msgid "Uninstall {app}?"
msgstr "要卸载 {app} 吗？"

#: src/mintmotion:1069
msgid ""
"The program and all its settings will be removed. The desktop will go back "
"to a static background."
msgstr "将移除本程序及其全部设置。桌面会恢复为静态背景。"

#: src/mintmotion:1071
msgid "Your videos will not be touched."
msgstr "不会动你的视频。"

#: src/mintmotion:1073
msgid "_Uninstall"
msgstr "卸载(_U)"

#: src/mintmotion:1078
#, python-brace-format
msgid "{app} is not installed as a package"
msgstr "{app} 不是以软件包形式安装的"

#: src/mintmotion:1079
msgid ""
"It seems to be installed from the source code. Uninstall it from that folder "
"with:"
msgstr "它似乎是从源代码安装的。请在该文件夹中运行以下命令卸载："

#: src/mintmotion:1083
msgid "pkexec is missing"
msgstr "缺少 pkexec"

#: src/mintmotion:1084
msgid ""
"Without pkexec I cannot ask for your password. Uninstall it from a terminal "
"with:"
msgstr "没有 pkexec 就无法请求你的密码。请在终端中运行以下命令卸载："

#: src/mintmotion:1094
#, python-brace-format
msgid "What should I do with the videos that {app} created?"
msgstr "如何处理 {app} 生成的视频？"

#: src/mintmotion:1095
#, python-brace-format
msgid "“Optimize for my screen” created <b>{n} video</b> ({size}) in"
msgid_plural "“Optimize for my screen” created <b>{n} videos</b> ({size}) in"
msgstr[0] "“为我的屏幕优化”生成了 <b>{n} 个视频</b>（{size}），位于"

#: src/mintmotion:1099
msgid "_Keep them"
msgstr "保留(_K)"

#: src/mintmotion:1100
msgid "_Delete them"
msgstr "删除(_D)"

#: src/mintmotion:1110
msgid "Uninstalling… enter your password if asked."
msgstr "正在卸载… 如有提示请输入密码。"

#: src/mintmotion:1129
msgid "You cancelled the password prompt."
msgstr "你取消了密码输入。"

#: src/mintmotion:1138
#, python-brace-format
msgid "The optimized videos are still in {folder}."
msgstr "优化后的视频仍在 {folder}。"

#: src/mintmotion:1140
#, python-brace-format
msgid "{app} has been uninstalled"
msgstr "{app} 已卸载"

#: src/mintmotion:1141
msgid "Nothing of the program remains on the computer."
msgstr "电脑上已没有本程序的任何残留。"

#: src/mintmotion:1147
msgid "It was not uninstalled"
msgstr "未能卸载"

#: src/mintmotion:1170
msgid "No video: your static desktop background is shown."
msgstr "无视频：显示的是静态桌面背景。"

#: src/mintmotion:1172
msgid "Playing on the desktop."
msgstr "正在桌面上播放。"

#: src/mintmotion:1175
msgid "Paused: the desktop is covered (it barely uses CPU)."
msgstr "已暂停：桌面被遮挡（几乎不占用 CPU）。"

#: src/mintmotion:1178
msgid ""
"Sleeping: the desktop has been covered for a while and the player was closed "
"to free its memory. When uncovered, it continues where it was."
msgstr ""
"休眠中：桌面已被遮挡一段时间，播放器已关闭以释放内存。桌面重新露出后会从原来"
"的位置继续播放。"

#: src/mintmotion:1182
#, python-brace-format
msgid "The player has failed several times (check {log})."
msgstr "播放器已多次出错（请查看 {log}）。"

#: src/mintmotion:1185
#, python-brace-format
msgid "Starting… (if this does not change, check {log})"
msgstr "正在启动…（如果一直如此，请查看 {log}）"

#: src/mintmotion:1188
msgid "There are changes not applied yet: press “Apply”."
msgstr "有尚未应用的更改：请点击“应用”。"

#: src/mintmotion:1190
msgid "Press “Apply” to set the video."
msgstr "点击“应用”即可设置视频。"

#: src/mintmotion:1206
msgid "measuring…"
msgstr "测量中…"

#: src/mintmotion:1212
#, no-python-format, python-brace-format
msgid "{total}% of total · {core}% of one core ({n} core)"
msgid_plural "{total}% of total · {core}% of one core ({n} cores)"
msgstr[0] "占总量 {total}% · 占单核 {core}%（共 {n} 核）"

#: src/mintmotion:1218
#, no-python-format, python-brace-format
msgid "{used} of {total} · {pct}%"
msgstr "{used} / {total} · {pct}%"

#: src/mintmotion:1241 src/mintmotion:1257
#, no-python-format, python-brace-format
msgid "Optimizing… {pct}%"
msgstr "正在优化… {pct}%"

#: src/mintmotion:1274
msgid "The video could not be optimized."
msgstr "无法优化该视频。"

#: src/mintmotion:1307
#, python-brace-format
msgid ""
"{app}: video as desktop background in Cinnamon and Xfce. Without arguments "
"it opens the settings window."
msgstr ""
"{app}：在 Cinnamon 和 Xfce 中将视频设为桌面背景。不带参数时打开设置窗口。"

#: src/mintmotion:1309
msgid "video to use as background (it also enables it)"
msgstr "用作背景的视频（同时启用）"

#: src/mintmotion:1310
msgid "screen fit"
msgstr "屏幕适应方式"

#: src/mintmotion:1311
msgid "scaling quality"
msgstr "缩放质量"

#: src/mintmotion:1313
msgid "pause when the desktop is covered"
msgstr "桌面被遮挡时暂停"

#: src/mintmotion:1314
msgid "hardware decoding"
msgstr "硬件解码"

#: src/mintmotion:1315
msgid "set the video as background"
msgstr "将视频设为背景"

#: src/mintmotion:1316
msgid "remove the video background"
msgstr "移除视频背景"

#: src/mintmotion:1317
msgid "show the status"
msgstr "显示状态"

#: src/mintmotion:1324
#, python-brace-format
msgid "could not migrate the previous version: {error}"
msgstr "无法迁移旧版本：{error}"

#: src/mintmotion:1336
#, python-brace-format
msgid "Does not exist: {path}"
msgstr "不存在：{path}"

#: src/mintmotion:1361
msgid "Cinnamon was not found (org.cinnamon schema)."
msgstr "未找到 Cinnamon（org.cinnamon 架构）。"

#: src/mintmotion:1364
msgid "yes"
msgstr "是"

#: src/mintmotion:1364
msgid "no"
msgstr "否"

#: src/mintmotion:1366
#, python-brace-format
msgid "enabled: {value}"
msgstr "已启用：{value}"

#: src/mintmotion:1367
#, python-brace-format
msgid "video: {value}"
msgstr "视频：{value}"

#: src/mintmotion:1367
msgid "(none)"
msgstr "（无）"

#: src/mintmotion:1368
#, python-brace-format
msgid ""
"fit: {fit} · quality: {quality} · hardware: {hw} · pause when covered: "
"{pause}"
msgstr "适应：{fit} · 质量：{quality} · 硬件解码：{hw} · 遮挡时暂停：{pause}"

#: src/mintmotion:1371
#, python-brace-format
msgid "state: {value}"
msgstr "状态：{value}"
